る手数料については、第二条の規定による改正前の領事官の徴収する手数料に関する政令第一条第六項及び第七項の規定は、なおその効力を有する。"]},{"tag":"Sentence","attr":{"Num":"2","WritingMode":"vertical"},"children":["この場合において、当該手数料に係る同条第六項及び第七項の規定の適用については、これらの規定中「旅券法施行令」とあるのは「旅券法施行令及び領事官の徴収する手数料に関する政令の一部を改正する政令（平成十一年政令第三百八十二号。以下「改正令」という。）による改正前の旅券法施行令」と、「第一項の規定」とあるのは「改正令による改正前の領事官の徴収する手数料に関する政令第一条第一項の規定」とする。"]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"SupplProvision","attr":{"AmendLawNum":"平成一二年六月七日政令第三〇六号","Extract":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"SupplProvisionLabel","attr":{},"children":["附　則"]},{"tag":"Article","attr":{"Delete":"false","Hide":"false","Num":"1"},"children":[{"tag":"ArticleCaption","attr":{},"children":["（施行期日）"]},{"tag":"ArticleTitle","attr":{},"children":["第一条"]},{"tag":"Paragraph","attr":{"Hide":"false","Num":"1","OldStyle":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"ParagraphNum","attr":{},"children":[]},{"tag":"ParagraphSentence","attr":{},"children":[{"tag":"Sentence","attr":{"WritingMode":"vertical"},"children":["この政令は、内閣法の一部を改正する法律（平成十一年法律第八十八号）の施行の日（平成十三年一月六日）から施行する。"]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"SupplProvision","attr":{"AmendLawNum":"平成一四年一二月一八日政令第三八五号","Extract":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"SupplProvisionLabel","attr":{},"children":["附　則"]},{"tag":"Article","attr":{"Delete":"false","Hide":"false","Num":"1"},"children":[{"tag":"ArticleCaption","attr":{},"children":["（施行期日）"]},{"tag":"ArticleTitle","attr":{},"children":["第一条"]},{"tag":"Paragraph","attr":{"Hide":"false","Num":"1","OldStyle":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"ParagraphNum","attr":{},"children":[]},{"tag":"ParagraphSentence","attr":{},"children":[{"tag":"Sentence","attr":{"WritingMode":"vertical"},"children":["この政令は、平成十五年四月一日から施行する。"]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"SupplProvision","attr":{"AmendLawNum":"平成一六年一一月二五日政令第三六八号"},"children":[{"tag":"SupplProvisionLabel","attr":{},"children":["附　則"]},{"tag":"Paragraph","attr":{"Hide":"false","Num":"1","OldStyle":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"ParagraphNum","attr":{},"children":[]},{"tag":"ParagraphSentence","attr":{},"children":[{"tag":"Sentence","attr":{"WritingMode":"vertical